# Optional local override only. Published / multi-user mode uses Connect profile
# (username + token stored in the browser). See docs/IMPORT.md.
# INSTAGRAM_TOKENS=your.username:IGAAxxxxxxxx

# Share links: local dev writes JSON under .data/shares/ (gitignored).
# Production (Vercel): pnpm add @vercel/blob && set a Blob store token.
# BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN=vercel_blob_rw_…
